(7476859, 1187395, 40391, '<td valign="top">Sad to see these captured animals. Though I would never have gotten to see one myself if it were not for zoos. I''m do torn. I do like the light of your shot.</td>', 'Sad to see these captured animals. Though I would never have gotten to see one myself if it were not for zoos. I''m do torn. I do like the light of your shot.', '2016-10-03 03:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
