(7478407, 1188411, 50695, '<td valign="top">I saw pretty much the same shot on Google + highlighted photos, so I guess that''s good...</td>', 'I saw pretty much the same shot on Google + highlighted photos, so I guess that''s good...', '2016-10-14 13:14:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7478553, 1188251, 140305, '<td valign="top">To me, my eye is first drawn to where the light is falling on the cars, which is unfortunately right where the power poles are situated so it takes the emphasis away from the cars. Also, I know you can''t help where they parked the vehicles, but the scene seems too cluttered (too many BG distractions). So, on the technical side it''s very well done but the scene itself is a problem. Just my opinion, hope this helps :)</td>', 'To me, my eye is first drawn to where the light is falling on the cars, which is unfortunately right where the power poles are situated so it takes the emphasis away from the cars. Also, I know you can''t help where they parked the vehicles, but the scene seems too cluttered (too many BG distractions). So, on the technical side it''s very well done but the scene itself is a problem. Just my opinion, hope this helps :)', '2016-10-16 12:59:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(7478555, 1188251, 138630, '<td valign="top">That does help, Mary Ann.  As you say, I couldn''t help the scene so that may well have made it a very poor choice for a challenge submission here.  But . . . there''s nothing to stop my trying to alter the background and details of the scene for other uses.  I think taking out the power poles would have the most positive and immediate impact.  And many of my other shots are close-ups of individual cars so they won''t have the same problems and I can certainly keep this in mind as I select which ones to work on and process them.  Thanks.</td>', 'That does help, Mary Ann.  As you say, I couldn''t help the scene so that may well have made it a very poor choice for a challenge submission here.  But . . . there''s nothing to stop my trying to alter the background and details of the scene for other uses.  I think taking out the power poles would have the most positive and immediate impact.  And many of my other shots are close-ups of individual cars so they won''t have the same problems and I can certainly keep this in mind as I select which ones to work on and process them.  Thanks.', '2016-10-16 13:45:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(7478627, 1188251, 118154, '<td valign="top">to a lot of folks this would be taken as a snap of a load of old cars, and as that it works well<br/>it looks like a nice day as far as the weather goes, which is always a bonus although i prefer the day to have some of those white clouds in varying sizes</td>', 'to a lot of folks this would be taken as a snap of a load of old cars, and as that it works wellit looks like a nice day as far as the weather goes, which is always a bonus although i prefer the day to have some of those white clouds in varying sizes', '2016-10-17 08:34:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(7478640, 1188251, 138630, '<td valign="top">Thanks, <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=118154" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Tiny</a>.  I''m one for interesting skies, too, though they might have made the image even busier and I''m not sure I''d like that here.  I''m thinking I''ll be playing with a few edits - like taking the poles out - and replacing the sky is something to consider.</td>', 'Thanks,  Tiny.  I''m one for interesting skies, too, though they might have made the image even busier and I''m not sure I''d like that here.  I''m thinking I''ll be playing with a few edits - like taking the poles out - and replacing the sky is something to consider.', '2016-10-17 11:08:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(7479071, 1188310, 117474, '<td valign="top">gorgeous. grainy deliciousness. trailblazer.</td>', 'gorgeous. grainy deliciousness. trailblazer.', '2016-10-21 19:16:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(7481207, 1188298, 115814, '<td valign="top">What a spectacular vista and a dramatic sky! I like that it''s not overly saturated and the tonal range is good without losing contrast or appearing overly processed. Nice work!</td>', 'What a spectacular vista and a dramatic sky! I like that it''s not overly saturated and the tonal range is good without losing contrast or appearing overly processed. Nice work!', '2016-11-06 19:01:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(7482118, 1188430, 86447, '<td valign="top">I agree with Abra.   Gorgeous... but I want sharp eyes.</td>', 'I agree with Abra.   Gorgeous... but I want sharp eyes.', '2016-11-11 17:02:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(7483265, 1188319, 115814, '<td valign="top"><i>Love that the color is not overly saturated. Lots of interesting detail, too. I do find my eyes having trouble with where to settle, though.</i></td>', 'Love that the color is not overly saturated. Lots of interesting detail, too. I do find my eyes having trouble with where to settle, though.', '2016-11-20 01:54:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(7483948, 1188336, 115814, '<td valign="top">Stopped by your profile page after seeing your name on the "Post Challenge Comments Volunteers" thread. Hadn''t seen this wonderful picture before - with a perfect title. The bands of color make it... as does the dusting of snow - I suspect you caught the tail of the color window with this. Nice.</td>', 'Stopped by your profile page after seeing your name on the "Post Challenge Comments Volunteers" thread. Hadn''t seen this wonderful picture before - with a perfect title. The bands of color make it... as does the dusting of snow - I suspect you caught the tail of the color window with this. Nice.', '2016-11-23 19:58:29.000000', NULL, 0);
